9","content":"❤️","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-08-21T05:02:29.000Z","createdAt":"2026-08-22T22:45:32.590Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-22T22:45:32.590Z"}],"createdAt":"2026-07-11T22:33:24.649Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-11T02:38:00.653Z"},{"id":"cnt_b0ab63f2dcc30c38a2565b0bf40b","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"instagram","profileHandle":"sudarshanpurohitofficial","profileDisplayName":"Angel Investor | Resorts | Meditation","format":"video","caption":"Small business = MORE risk. \nBig dreams = LESS risk.\n\nSab sochte hain ki bada business karna risky hota hai.\nBut the truth? It’s the complete opposite.\n\nChhoti dukaan wala din bhar dukaan pe baithta hai. Khud hi worker, khud hi boss. \n\nEk din beemar pada business band. \nEk wrong decision and sab khatam.\nAnd on the other side? Bade businesses wale yacht pe ghoom rahe hain.\n\nWhy? \n\nBecause they stopped playing a solo game and built a team.\n\nJab team strong hoti hai, systems hote hain, captain duck pe bhi chala jaaye, team jeet jaati hai. \nBusiness runs itself.\n\nThe real game is this:\nThink big - really big\nSet revenue targets that scare you\nBuild a team stronger than you\nCreate systems that work without you\n\nJab ye sab ho jaaye and tumhare paas koi kaam hi nahi bachta & team sambhal leti hai.\nThat’s the difference between a small shop and a real business. \n\nIt’s not about mindset - it’s about structure.\n\nAgar abhi bhi sab kuch khud kar rahe ho then you’re not running a business. You’re doing a job where you’re also the boss.\n\nDrop a comment are you an employee in your own business, or an owner?\n\n#entrepreneurmindset #business #decisionmaking #fyp","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_c58dc63dd854baf318cdc3f5e532","publishedAt":"2026-06-28T14:44:35.000Z","profileId":"prf_c0131da27ba278f7aedf4194e2bf","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DaIgk0XvyLu/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":11891624,"likesCount":515442,"sharesCount":150410,"commentsCount":629,"interactionsCount":666481,"engagementRatePerViews":5.604625575110683,"engagementRatePerFollowers":1551.1462285009425,"profileFollowersCount":42967,"profileFollowingCount":5,"profilePostsCount":114,"mediaCount":1,"duration":36.152,"hashtags":["#entrepreneurmindset","#business","#decisionmaking","#fyp"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[],"platformId":"DaIgk0XvyLu","profilePlatformId":"73363424889","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/sudarshanpurohitofficial/pfp.webp","profileBio":"💡| Sharing Lessons on Startup Growth & Wealth \n⚡️| Founder @ravishingretreat @hongsau_bliss @mybalancebite","profileVerified":true,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"जितना चोटा दंदा उतना ज्यादा रिस्क है। चोटी दुकानों वाले दिन पर दुकान पर बैठते हैं, तारे बड़े बिजनेसे वाले यॉट पर गूम रहे होते हैं। अब को क्या लगता है? बड़ा सपने में ज्यादा डर, ज्यादा रिस्क है। बड़ा सपने में कम रिस्क है। बिजनस इंडिविज्विज्व गेम नहीं है, बिजनस एक टीम गेम है। टीम जब बनेगी तुम्हारे पास, जब तुम्हारे पास ऑपर्चुनिटी है। अगर टीम बहुत ही स्ट्रॉंग है, तो कैप्टन भली डख पे चला जाए, तो भी जिद जाती है। गेम का गेम क्या है, कि भाईयो बड़ा सपना सोचना, बड़ा रेवन्यू को हिट करने की कोशिश करना, एक स्ट्रॉंग टीम बनाना। जब वो बन जाए, तो उसके पास कुई काम ही नहीं भाई, क्योंकि टीम है न, उसके पास सिस्टम्स है न, जो संभाल रहे हैं।","transcriptLanguage":"hi","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.005,"endSeconds":2.565,"text":"जितना चोटा दंदा उतना ज्यादा रिस्क है।"},{"startSeconds":2.565,"endSeconds":6.605,"text":"चोटी दुकानों वाले दिन पर दुकान पर बैठते हैं, तारे बड़े बिजनेसे वाले यॉट पर गूम रहे होते हैं।"},{"startSeconds":6.605,"endSeconds":7.605,"text":"अब को क्या लगता है?"},{"startSeconds":7.605,"endSeconds":10.325,"text":"बड़ा सपने में ज्यादा डर, ज्यादा रिस्क है।"